OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is the wildfire-affected A31
OL,4,Astill closed and when will it reopen?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve days ago a wildfire spread
OL,7,Fthrough the New Forest after a van
OL,8,Fburst into flames, causing the closure
OL,9,Fof a major tourist road.
OL,11,FThe A31 near Ringwood is still shut
OL,12,Fdespite hopes it would be back in
OL,13,Faction on Thursday, and according to
OL,14,FNational Highways repairs are "more
OL,15,Fsubstantial" than originally thought.
OL,17,FWe take a closer look at why the route
OL,18,Fhas been out of commission and when it
OL,19,Fwill reopen to the thousands of
OL,20,Fmotorists who use it daily.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
