OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is the wildfire-affected A31
OL,4,Astill closed and when will it reopen?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A31, a dual carriageway through the
OL,7,FNew Forest and a tourist route to
OL,8,FDorset and south-west England, was
OL,9,Fclosed in both directions between
OL,10,FRingwood and Cadnam on Sunday 9 August.
